text CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BillDoesWhateverForRareMons {
    "That Bill!\p"
    "I heard that he'll do whatever it\n"
    "takes to get rare Pokémon.\p"
    "He's not above doing all sorts\n"
    "of things, I've heard.$"
}

text CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_EveryoneCallsBillPokemaniac {
    "Have you heard about Bill?\p"
    "Everyone calls him a Pokémaniac!\p"
    "I think people are just jealous of\n"
    "Bill, though.\p"
    "Who wouldn't want to boast about\n"
    "their Pokémon?$"
}

text CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BillCollectsRareMons {
    "Bill has lots of Pokémon!\n"
    "He collects rare ones, too!$"
}

text CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TryTradingUpstairs {
    "Why don't you go upstairs and try\n"
    "trading Pokémon with your friends?\p"
    "You could get a lot more variety\n"
    "by trading.\p"
    "The Pokémon you get in trades grow\n"
    "quickly, too.$"
}
